<!--
id: CL01
name: Claim link
layout: personal
kind: transactional
sender: rishi
category: account
topic: none
trigger: claim_link_sent
phase: 1
subject: {{ trigger.amount | default: "Some" }} Hydrilla credits for you
preheader: Claim them with one click.
footer_reason: You're receiving this because someone at Hydrilla sent you a credit link.
optional: false
send_rule: sent by an admin from the Claim links page, one recipient per send
facts: bonus credits carry over (docs/PAYMENTS.md), so no expiry is stated for the credits themselves, only for the link
data: name, email, amount, reason, claim_url, expires_on
-->
<mj-text>Hi {{ trigger.name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-text>I've set aside {{ trigger.amount | default: "some" }} Hydrilla credits for you{% if trigger.reason %} ({{ trigger.reason | default: "" | escape }}){% endif %}. You can use them to generate 3D models in Studio.</mj-text>
<mj-text><a href="{{ trigger.claim_url | default: 'https://hydrilla.ai/app/studio' }}">Claim your credits</a></mj-text>
<mj-raw>{% if trigger.email %}</mj-raw>
<mj-text>Sign in, or create an account, with {{ trigger.email | default: "" | escape }}. The link only works with that address.</mj-text>
<mj-raw>{% endif %}{% if trigger.expires_on %}</mj-raw>
<mj-text>The link is open until {{ trigger.expires_on | default: "" }}.</mj-text>
<mj-raw>{% endif %}</mj-raw>
<mj-text>If anything doesn't work, reply to this email.</mj-text>
<mj-text>Rishi<br />Creative Director, Hydrilla</mj-text>
